function launch(retry=false){if(engine)return;const r=state.run;if(retry&&!retryFlight(r))return;if(!beginFlightAttempt(r))return goToRun();screen='flight';paused=false;persist();renderHeader();document.body.classList.add('playing');document.body.dataset.screen='flight';const n=r.current;app.innerHTML=`<section class="flight-shell"><div class="flight-device"><div class="flight-hud"><div><div class="flight-title">${r.isTutorial?'PRACTICE':`${r.testMode?'TEST · ':''}ASC ${r.difficulty} · MAP ${r.mapIndex+1}/3`}</div>${livesMarkup(r)}<div class="boss-phase-hud" id="boss-phase"></div></div><div class="flight-topstats"><span class="ember-counter">${icon('ember')}<b id="flight-embers">0</b><small>EMBERS</small></span></div><span class="flight-menu-slot">${menuButton()}</span></div><div class="flame-hud"><span>GLOW</span><div id="flame-meter" role="meter" aria-label="Glow fuel" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100"><i id="flame-fill"></i></div><b id="flame-value">${Math.round(r.flame)}</b></div><div class="flight-progress"><i id="flight-progress-bar"></i></div><div class="canvas-wrap"><canvas id="flight-canvas" aria-label="Fly your light. Lift and Power are below on the right. MENU pauses."></canvas><div class="flight-event" id="flight-event"></div>${performanceEnabled?'<div class="perf-status" id="perf-status">MEASURING…</div>':''}<div class="tutorial-flight-hint" id="tutorial-hint" hidden></div></div><div class="flight-dock"><div class="flight-fleet-status" id="fleet-status">${fleetArt()}</div>${boostControlMarkup(r.companions)}<button class="flight-control flap-control" id="flap-btn">${icon('wing')}<span id="flap-label">LIFT</span></button></div><div id="pause-layer"></div></div></section>`;
  hud={glow:document.querySelector('#flame-value'),fill:document.querySelector('#flame-fill'),meter:document.querySelector('#flame-meter'),embers:document.querySelector('#flight-embers'),progress:document.querySelector('#flight-progress-bar'),power:document.querySelector('#boost-btn'),event:document.querySelector('#flight-event'),flap:document.querySelector('#flap-label'),boss:document.querySelector('#boss-phase')};
  engine=new WispFlight({canvas:document.querySelector('#flight-canvas'),terrain:n.terrain,elite:n.elite,seed:`${r.seed}-${n.id}`,duration:n.duration,node:n,challengeId:n.challengeId,challengeTarget:n.challengeTarget,flame:r.flame,companions:r.companions,companionRole:r.companions[0],skills:r.skills,cards:[],modifiers:getRunModifiers(r),onUpdate:updateFlight,onFinish:completeFlight,onPause:()=>{if(!paused){paused=true;showMenu()}}});engine.setMuted?.(muted);if(performanceEnabled)flightPerformance=attachFlightPerformance(engine,{onStatus:s=>{const indicator=document.querySelector('#perf-status');if(indicator)setText(indicator,`${s.fps} FPS · worst ${s.worstGap}ms · ${s.stalls} stalls`)}});bindFlightControls();engine.start();if(r.isTutorial&&!r.guideSeen?.flight)requestAnimationFrame(()=>guideScreen('flight'));
}
function liftCostLabel(value){return (Number.isFinite(Number(value))?Number(value):7).toFixed(2).replace(/\.?0+$/,'')}
function setText(el,text){if(el&&el.textContent!==String(text))el.textContent=text}
function updateFlight(s){lastSnapshot=s;if(!hud)return;const glow=Math.max(0,Math.round(s.flame));setText(hud.glow,glow);if(hud.fill.dataset.value!==String(glow)){hud.fill.dataset.value=glow;hud.fill.style.transform=`scaleX(${glow/(s.maxFlame||100)})`;hud.meter.setAttribute('aria-valuenow',glow)}setText(hud.embers,Math.floor(s.embers||0));hud.progress.style.transform=`scaleX(${Math.min(1,s.progress||0)})`;setText(hud.event,flightCue(s));setText(hud.flap,s.completing?'CLEAR':s.dying?'FADING':`LIFT −${liftCostLabel(s.flapCost)}`);setText(hud.boss,s.bossWarning||s.bossPhase||'');updateBoostControl(hud.power,s);if(engine?.tutorial&&!s.completing&&s.tutorialHintState&&!lesson){const hint=document.querySelector('#tutorial-hint');if(hint){hint.hidden=false;const key=s.tutorialHintState.id;if(hint.dataset.key!==key){hint.dataset.key=key;hint.innerHTML=`<strong>${esc(s.tutorialHintState.title)}</strong><p>${esc(s.tutorialHintState.text)}</p>`}}}if(!paused&&!lesson&&!s.dying)queueMicrotask(worldLesson)}
function bindFlightControls(){const lift=document.querySelector('#flap-btn'),power=document.querySelector('#boost-btn');lift.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{e.preventDefault();if(!paused&&!lesson)engine?.flap()});lift.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.detail===0&&!paused&&!lesson)engine?.flap()});if(power?.tagName==='BUTTON'){power.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{e.preventDefault();if(!paused&&!lesson)engine?.activateAbility()});power.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.detail===0&&!paused&&!lesson)engine?.activateAbility()})}document.querySelector('.canvas-wrap').addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{e.preventDefault();if(!paused&&!lesson)engine?.flap()})}
function completeFlight(result){hideLesson();const previous=engine;engine=null;hud=null;previous?.destroy();paused=false;document.body.classList.remove('playing');finishFlight(state.run,result);if(result.success){const n=settleCheckpoint(state);if(n)notify(`+${n} RUN EMBERS`);if(state.run.success&&!state.run.isTutorial)selectedDifficulty=state.profile.difficulty}persist();goToRun()}
const coach=createTutorialCoach({onNext:()=>{if(!lesson)return;if(++lesson.index<lesson.steps.length)return showLessonStep();const done=lesson.done,key=lesson.key;if(state.run){state.run.guideSeen||={};state.run.guideSeen[key]=true}hideLesson();persist();done?.()},onBack:()=>{if(lesson&&lesson.index>0){lesson.index--;showLessonStep()}},onSkip:()=>{if(!lesson)return;const done=lesson.done;if(lesson.key.startsWith('pickup:'))state.profile.pickupCoachSkipped=true;else if(state.run)state.run.guideSkipped=true;hideLesson();persist();done?.()}});
function hideLesson(){lesson=null;coach.hide();document.querySelector('[data-world-focus]')?.remove()}
function startLesson(key,steps,done){if(lesson||!steps.length)return;const real=steps.filter(s=>typeof s.target!=='string'||document.querySelector(s.target));if(!real.length)return;lesson={key,steps:real,index:0,done};showLessonStep()}
function showLessonStep(){const s=lesson.steps[lesson.index];coach.show({...s,id:`${lesson.key}:${lesson.index}`,progress:`${lesson.index+1}/${lesson.steps.length}`,actionLabel:lesson.index===lesson.steps.length-1?'Continue':'Next'})}
function guideScreen(view){
  const r=state.run;if(!r||lesson)return;
  if(!r.isTutorial){if(view==='result'&&r.afterglowJustUnlocked&&!r.guideSeen?.unlock)startLesson('unlock',[{title:'Afterglow unlocked',text:'Bank spare fuel after a clear and draw it before a flight.',target:'.afterglow-unlock'}]);return}
  if(r.guideSkipped)return;
  if(view==='support'&&!r.guideSeen?.support)startLesson('support',[{title:'Take a breather',text:'Choose some fuel or practice Embers. Upgrades can wait until you feel ready.',target:'.support-offers'}]);
  else if(view==='flight'){
    const key=r.current?.tutorialLesson==='wind'?'flight-wind':'flight';if(r.guideSeen?.[key])return;
    pauseFlight();const active=r.companions.some(id=>!getCompanionAbility(id).passive);
    const step=key==='flight'?{title:'Find your rhythm',text:'Tap Lift, then let go to glide. Bright packets refill your Glow.',target:'#flap-btn'}
      :active?{title:'Try your power when ready',text:'Tap Power when it helps. There is no need to rush.',target:'#boost-btn'}
      :{title:'A little help nearby',text:'Your companion works automatically. Keep practicing gentle lifts and glides.',target:'#boost-btn'};
    startLesson(key,[step],resumeFlight);
  }
}

function worldLesson(){if(!engine||paused||lesson||lastSnapshot?.dying||lastSnapshot?.completing)return;const r=state.run,practice=!!engine.tutorial;let focus,key,content;if(practice){if(r.guideSkipped||engine.time<3)return;const prefix='world:',seen=new Set(Object.keys(r.guideSeen||{}).filter(k=>k.startsWith(prefix)).map(k=>k.slice(prefix.length)));focus=getTutorialWorldFocus(engine,seen);if(!focus)return;const wanted=engine.tutorial.lesson==='glide'?'light-packet':'draft';if(focus.id!==wanted||r.guideSeen?.[`world:${wanted}`])return;focus={...focus,text:focus.id==='light-packet'?'Touch this light to refill Glow.':'These curls push you. Take your time and fly around them.'};key=`world:${focus.id}`;content=focus}else{const seen=new Set(state.profile.seenPickups||[]);if(seen.size>=7)return;focus=engine.getNearbyPickup(seen);if(!focus)return;key=`pickup:${focus.kind}`;content=pickupLesson(focus.kind,{companions:roleFleet()});state.profile.seenPickups||=[];state.profile.seenPickups.push(focus.kind);if(state.profile.pickupCoachSkipped){persist();return}}pauseFlight();const wrap=document.querySelector('.canvas-wrap'),canvas=document.querySelector('#flight-canvas'),target=document.createElement('i'),c=canvas.getBoundingClientRect(),w=wrap.getBoundingClientRect(),sx=c.width/engine.width,sy=c.height/engine.height,rad=Math.max(18,focus.radius||18);target.dataset.worldFocus='';target.style.cssText=`position:absolute;pointer-events:none;left:${c.left-w.left+(focus.x-rad)*sx}px;top:${c.top-w.top+(focus.y-rad)*sy}px;width:${rad*2*sx}px;height:${rad*2*sy}px`;wrap.appendChild(target);startLesson(key,[{...content,target}],resumeFlight)}
function mapLabelLines(value,max=14){const words=String(value||'').split(/\s+/),lines=[];let line='';for(const word of words){if((line+' '+word).trim().length>max&&line){lines.push(line);line=word}else line=(line+' '+word).trim()}if(line)lines.push(line);return lines.slice(0,2).map(v=>v.length>max?v.slice(0,max-1)+'…':v)}
function mapPositionMarker(x,y,label){return `<g class="map-position-marker map-orb-marker" transform="translate(${x},${y})"><circle r="12" fill="#dce8d1" opacity=".25"/><circle r="6" fill="#f2f0d5"/><text y="24" text-anchor="middle">${label}</text></g>`}

function drawMap(){
  const r=state.run,height=mapHeight(r),origin=height-57,svg=document.querySelector('#journey-map');if(!svg)return;
  const choices=getChoices(r),available=new Set(choices.map(n=>n.id)),visited=new Set(r.path),positions={},byId=new Map(r.map.flat().map(n=>[n.id,n]));
  const modern=r.map.some(row=>row.some(n=>Array.isArray(n.nextIds)));
  r.map.forEach((row,i)=>row.forEach((n,j)=>{const lane=modern?(Number.isInteger(n.lane)?n.lane:j):(row.length===2?j*2:1);positions[n.id]={x:[65,195,325][lane]??195,y:height-165-i*160};}));
  const nextNodes=n=>Array.isArray(n.nextIds)?n.nextIds.map(id=>byId.get(id)).filter(Boolean):(r.map[n.row+1]||[]);
  const future=new Set(available),queue=[...choices];while(queue.length){for(const n of nextNodes(queue.shift()))if(!future.has(n.id)){future.add(n.id);queue.push(n);}}
  const takenEdges=new Set(r.path.slice(1).map((id,i)=>`${r.path[i]}|${id}`)),last=r.path.at(-1);
  let paths='',locations='',decorations='',clips='';
  const pathMarkup=(d,taken,open,locked,id)=>`<g class="map-route-line ${taken?'path-taken':open?'path-open':locked?'path-locked':'path-future'}"><path d="${d}" class="route-shadow"/><path id="${id}" d="${d}" class="route-thread"/>${open?`<path d="${d}" class="route-current" marker-end="url(#mapUpArrow)"/>`:''}</g>`;
  r.map.forEach(row=>row.forEach(a=>{for(const b of nextNodes(a)){const p=positions[a.id],q=positions[b.id];if(!p||!q)continue;const d=`M${p.x} ${p.y-33} C${p.x} ${p.y-79},${q.x} ${q.y+81},${q.x} ${q.y+34}`;paths+=pathMarkup(d,takenEdges.has(`${a.id}|${b.id}`),a.id===last&&available.has(b.id),!future.has(a.id)||!future.has(b.id),`route-${a.id}-${b.id}`);}}));
  const starts=(Array.isArray(r.startNodeIds)?r.startNodeIds:r.map[0].map(n=>n.id)).map(id=>byId.get(id)).filter(Boolean);
  for(const node of starts){const q=positions[node.id],d=`M195 ${origin} C195 ${origin-39},${q.x} ${origin-33},${q.x} ${q.y+34}`;paths+=pathMarkup(d,r.path[0]===node.id,r.path.length===0&&available.has(node.id),r.path.length>0&&r.path[0]!==node.id,`origin-${node.id}`);}
  for(let i=0;i<66;i++){const x=(i*137+41)%390,y=(i*211+73)%height;decorations+=`<circle cx="${x}" cy="${y}" r="${i%5===0?1.6:.7}" fill="#f5dcad" opacity="${.16+(i%4)*.07}"/>`;}
  for(let i=0;i<Math.ceil(runLength(r)*1.3);i++){const x=i%2?320:42,y=170+i*119;decorations+=`<g opacity=".17" transform="translate(${x},${y}) rotate(${i%2?-9:8})"><path d="M-53 8Q-37-12-15-6L8-19 40-7 55 15 26 34-4 47-28 29Z" fill="#323a34"/><path d="M-38 5Q-10-14 33-2" fill="none" stroke="#b8c692" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M-17-8v-29h8v26m20-1v-24h7v27m-42-23q23-23 48 0" fill="none" stroke="#68705d" stroke-width="5"/></g>`;}
  r.map.forEach((row,i)=>row.forEach(n=>{
    const p=positions[n.id],reach=available.has(n.id),taken=visited.has(n.id),bypassed=i<r.step&&!taken,possible=future.has(n.id),stop=getMapStopInfo(n);
    const location=n.type==='support'?null:nodeLocation(n),name=stop.name||n.locationName||n.name,lines=mapLabelLines(name),ascent=r.isTutorial?i+1:getAscentInfo(n).level;
    const type=n.boss?'BOSS':stop.kind==='flight'?'FLIGHT':stop.kind==='elite'?'ELITE':stop.label;
    const forecast=reach&&!r.isTutorial?getRouteForecast(r,n):null;
    const forecastText=forecast?(forecast.nextRestDistance===0?'REST HERE':forecast.restReachable?`REST ≤${forecast.nextRestDistance}`:'NO REST AHEAD'):'';
    const glyph=`<g class="map-support-symbol">${mapStopIconMarkup(n).replace('<svg ',`<svg x="${p.x-22}" y="${p.y-22}" width="44" height="44" `)}</g>`;
    locations+=`<g class="world-map-node map-stop-${stop.kind} ${reach?'reachable':''} ${taken?'taken':''} ${bypassed?'bypassed':''} ${!possible&&!taken?'unreachable':''}" ${reach?`data-action="node" data-id="${esc(n.id)}" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Inspect ${type}: ${esc(name)}. ${esc(stop.summary)}. ${esc(n.setpiecePreview||location?.signature||'')}. ${esc(n.fuelPreview||n.description)}. ${esc(n.reward)}"`:''}>
      <title>${type}: ${esc(name)}. ${esc(stop.summary)}</title>
      ${reach?`<rect x="${p.x-51}" y="${p.y-44}" width="102" height="138" fill="transparent" pointer-events="all"/>`:''}
      <ellipse cx="${p.x}" cy="${p.y+35}" rx="39" ry="10" fill="#05171e" opacity=".5"/>
      ${reach?`<circle class="node-aureole" cx="${p.x}" cy="${p.y}" r="48" fill="url(#nodeRadiance)"/><circle class="node-pulse" cx="${p.x}" cy="${p.y}" r="38" fill="none" stroke="#e8f1d4" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="${p.x}" cy="${p.y}" r="43" fill="none" stroke="#d5e5bc" stroke-opacity=".28"/>`:''}
      <circle cx="${p.x}" cy="${p.y}" r="34" fill="#142c25" stroke="${reach||taken?'#c6d5a7':'#667f70'}" stroke-width="${reach?2:1}"/>
      ${glyph}
      ${taken?`<circle cx="${p.x+24}" cy="${p.y+24}" r="10" fill="#a8bd89" stroke="#173322" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m${p.x+19} ${p.y+24} 3 3 7-7" fill="none" stroke="#173b27" stroke-width="1.8"/>`:''}
      <text x="${p.x}" y="${p.y+54}" class="map-node-type" text-anchor="middle">${type}</text>
      <text x="${p.x}" y="${p.y+72}" class="map-node-name map-node-detail" text-anchor="middle">${lines.map((text,index)=>`<tspan x="${p.x}" dy="${index?14:0}">${esc(text)}</tspan>`).join('')}</text>
      ${forecastText?`<text x="${p.x}" y="${p.y+107}" class="map-rest-forecast ${forecast.restReachable?'':'danger'}" text-anchor="middle">${esc(forecastText)}</text>`:''}
      ${last===n.id?mapPositionMarker(p.x-47,p.y+1,'YOU'):''}
    </g>`;
  }));
  svg.innerHTML=`<defs><marker id="mapUpArrow" viewBox="0 0 6 6" refX="5" refY="3" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto" markerUnits="strokeWidth"><path d="M0 0 6 3 0 6Z" fill="#dcebc5"/></marker><linearGradient id="atlasSky" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#102a3b"/><stop offset=".46" stop-color="#173c3e"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#0b2930"/></linearGradient><radialGradient id="moonRadiance"><stop stop-color="#e9dbac" stop-opacity=".30"/><stop offset=".35" stop-color="#c1d9c0" stop-opacity=".10"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#a6d8c9" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient><radialGradient id="nodeRadiance"><stop stop-color="#f5cd81" stop-opacity=".27"/><stop offset=".63" stop-color="#f5cd81" stop-opacity=".10"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#f5cd81" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient><linearGradient id="mapIsland" x2=".4" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#7f9d85"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#173544"/></linearGradient><pattern id="atlasContour" width="195" height="220" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M-30 80Q27 12 107 75T235 72M-30 95Q27 27 107 90T235 87M-30 112Q27 44 107 107T235 104" stroke="#a2bc9d" stroke-opacity=".05" fill="none"/></pattern>${clips}</defs><rect width="390" height="${height}" fill="url(#atlasSky)"/><rect width="390" height="${height}" fill="url(#atlasContour)"/><circle cx="195" cy="90" r="155" fill="url(#moonRadiance)"/><circle cx="195" cy="88" r="26" fill="#e9d8a5" opacity=".72"/><circle cx="205" cy="80" r="24" fill="#193641"/><path d="M24 64Q195 8 366 64M24 ${height-18}Q195 ${height+24} 366 ${height-18}" stroke="#9eae8866" stroke-width="1" fill="none"/>${decorations}${paths}${locations}${mapPositionMarker(195,origin,'START')}<text x="195" y="36" class="map-gate-title" text-anchor="middle">${r.isTutorial?'FIRST LIGHT':esc((r.mapName||'THE ASCENT').toUpperCase())}</text>`;
  const viewport=document.querySelector('#map-viewport'),target=positions[choices[0]?.id];
  if(viewport&&target){const ratio=svg.getBoundingClientRect().width/390;viewport.scrollTop=Math.max(0,target.y*ratio-viewport.clientHeight*.62);}
}

document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const btn=e.target.closest('[data-action]');if(!btn||btn.disabled)return;const action=btn.dataset.action,id=btn.dataset.id;switch(action){case'performance-report':if(flightPerformance)downloadPerformanceReport(flightPerformance.report());break;case'inspect-branch-skill':mainSkillSelection=id;showSkills();break;case'inspect-main-skill':mainSkillSelection=id;showSkills('main');break;case'choose-start-skill':if(chooseStartingSkill(state,id)){mainSkillSelection=id;persist();render(screen);showSkills('main');notify('STARTING GIFT LEARNED')}break;case'test-override':toggleTestOverride();break;case'test-starter':if(setTestStarterCompanion(state,id)){persist();render('home')}break;case'play':closeSheet();beginRun();break;case'continue-run':closeSheet();goToRun();break;case'new-game':requestNewGame();break;case'confirm-new-game':beginRun(true);break;case'exit-menu':exitToMenu();break;case'abandon-run':requestAbandon();break;case'confirm-abandon':endRun();break;case'companion-unlocks':showUnlocks();break;case'choose-ascension':selectedDifficulty=Math.max(1,Math.min(state.settings.testOverride?Math.max(6,state.profile.difficulty||1):state.profile.difficulty||1,Number(btn.dataset.value)||1));render('home');break;case'home':exitToMenu();break;case'menu':showMenu();break;case'resume':resumeFlight();break;case'close-sheet':closeSheet();break;case'tutorial':enterTutorial();break;case'skip-practice':exitTutorial();break;case'leave-practice':if(state.run?.success)state.profile.tutorialComplete=true;exitTutorial();break;case'mute':muted=!muted;localStorage.setItem('emberwing-muted',String(muted));engine?.setMuted?.(muted);showMenu();break;case'node':if(selectNode(state.run,id)){persist();goToRun()}break;case'back-route':backRoute();break;case'support':if(resolveSupport(state.run,Number(btn.dataset.index),state.profile)){settleCheckpoint(state);persist();goToRun()}else notify('Not enough resources, or this offer is no longer available.');break;case'launch':launch();break;case'retry':launch(true);break;case'end-run':requestAbandon();break;case'next-map':if(advanceMap(state.run)){persist();goToRun()}break;case'skills':showSkills();break;case'bond-tree':showSkills('main');break;case'tree-branch':showSkills(id);break;case'buy-skill':if(buyCheckpointSkill(state,id)){persist();showSkills();renderHeader();notify(SKILLS[id]?.choiceGroup?'PATH CHOSEN · THIS RUN':'UPGRADE LEARNED · THIS RUN')}break;case'companions':showFleet();break;case'fleet-slot':if(Number(btn.dataset.index)>=getCompanionCapacity(state.run&&state.run.phase!=='ended'?state.run:state.profile))showSkills('main');else{fleetSlot=Number(btn.dataset.index);showFleet()}break;case'fleet-role':chooseFleet(id);break;case'artifacts':if(btn.dataset.slot!==undefined)artifactSlot=Number(btn.dataset.slot);showArtifacts();break;case'artifact-slot':artifactSlot=Number(btn.dataset.index);showArtifacts();break;case'equip-artifact':if(equipArtifact(state,id,artifactSlot)){persist();render(screen);showArtifacts()}break;case'sell-artifact':if(sellArtifact(state,id)){persist();render(screen);showArtifacts()}break;case'pickup-key':showPickupKey();break;case'map-key':showMapKey();break;case'reserve':showReserve();break;case'inspect-afterglow':showReserve();break;case'draw-afterglow':{const n=drawAfterglow(state.run);if(n){persist();render('briefing');notify(`+${n} GLOW`)}}break;case'close-power':closeSheet();break}});
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(coach.active||document.querySelector('dialog[open]'))return;if(engine){if(['Space','ArrowUp','KeyB','Escape'].includes(e.code))e.preventDefault();if(e.repeat)return;if(e.code==='Escape')showMenu();else if(!paused&&['Space','ArrowUp'].includes(e.code))engine.flap();else if(!paused&&e.code==='KeyB')engine.activateAbility()}else{const node=e.target.closest?.('.world-map-node[role=button]');if(node&&['Enter',' '].includes(e.key)){e.preventDefault();if(selectNode(state.run,node.dataset.id)){persist();goToRun()}}}});
document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden&&engine&&!engine.dying&&!paused){pauseFlight();showMenu()}});
window.addEventListener('pagehide',persist);
if(state.run?.isTutorial){leaveTutorial(state);persist()}
render('home');
